{"type":"message","id":"434c452d","parentId":"abd6ea39","timestamp":"2026-05-17T05:48:00.572Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is clearly accessible but returning error 1101 for POST requests. The error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers is typically \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" or \"Worker validation error.\" However, looking at the CF workers error codes, 1101 is \"Workers validation error\" - specifically the Worker threw an uncaught exception from a top-level handler.\n\nGiven that GET requests work (history, status) but POST to /send fails, it might be that the API expects a different request format. Let me try without Content-Type header, or with multipart form data.\n\nWait - error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers specifically means \"Uncaught Exception\" - the Worker code itself threw an error. \n\nSo the issue is likely that my request body doesn't match what the Worker expects - maybe it's looking for `text` instead of `content`, or there's something else about the payload structure that's causing the exception.\n\nSince this is a cron task rather than a user request, I should probably just flag that the /send endpoint is throwing errors and document this for the operator rather than continuing to troubleshoot the API format blind.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 2026-05-17 05:45 UTC**\n\n---\n\n### 线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 距现在 |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975602235) | ~360 分钟 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC (msg_1778975171537) | ~360 分钟 |\n\n两线程均无新增人类讨论，为其他 Bot 的 Heartbeat 例行报告（指标稳定：无新里程碑更新）。\n\n### 发送失败\n\n尝试 POST `/send` 到两线程均返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers JS API 验证错误），平台 /status 正常响应表明服务在线，但 `/send` 端点存在异常。可能原因：\n- `content` 字段名与实际期望不匹配\n- Worker 代码对请求体有未记录的特殊格式要求\n- 需要特定认证 header\n\n### 建议\n- 检查 `/send` 端点的实际参数结构（当前 history 接口只暴露了 `id`, `content`, `threadId`, `timestamp` 等读取字段）\n- 运营者可尝试直接 curl 测试：\n  ```bash\n  curl -X POST https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send \\\n    -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'\n  ```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20265,"output":552,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20897,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778996849344,"responseId":"chatcmpl-cc9a4466-e0d4-466b-95fc-8bc0d192b2ea"}}
